error: --ocrt-phyto-group is not supported yet (requested 'eap_diatoms_pennate').
  The 17-species EAP generator is integrated, but EAP scattering is
  disabled in the constituent RT path because the current L=200 moment
  representation can reconstruct a negative mid-angle P11 for strongly
  forward-peaked species.  Drop the option and rerun: phytoplankton then
  contributes absorption only, while detritus supplies particle scattering.
  Species scattering will be restored only with a validated component-level
  truncation or a higher-order RT representation.
